{"title": "未知", "index": 81, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre2\">\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00091.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withmanycharactors1\">完成《作为意志和表象的世界》第一部时的叔本华（30岁）</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00075.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors1\">沉思中的叔本华</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00025.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors1\">叔本华的偶像　康德（1724—1804）</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00087.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors1\">《叔本华著作全集》德文版的扉页</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00046.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors1\">《作为意志和表象的世界》原稿之一</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00094.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors1\">叔本华（1788—1860），德国悲观主义哲学家</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00013.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors1\">叔本华与他的对手黑格尔（1770—1831）</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00045.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors1\">德国唯意志论代表人物阿瑟·叔本华（1788—1860）</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00005.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors1\">叔本华藏书票</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00012.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withmanycharactors1\">叔本华的母亲约翰娜·叔本华（左）和他的妹妹（右）</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00041.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors1\">法兰克福的叔本华故居</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00029.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors1\">叔本华纪念室一角</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00057.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withmanycharactors1\">叔本华安眠之地：法兰克福北郊的中央公墓</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00039.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors1\">叔本华胸像</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00090.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors1\">叔本华与他的卷毛狗散步素描</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00008.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors1\">叔本华自画像</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00022.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors1\">法兰克福的叔本华纪念碑</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-div-alone\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"kindle-cn-bodycontent-image-alone80-withnote\" src=\"../images/00071.jpeg\"/>\n<p class=\"kindle-cn-picture-txt-withfewcharactors1\">叔本华纪念碑台座的狮身人面像斯芬克司</p>\n</div>\n</body>"}]}